      "executiveSummary": "Comprehensive Executive Directive for 'Muttom Depot Solar PV Rooftop Installation Bid #138': Evaluated under KMRL ENGINEERING Protocols and MoHUA transit safety standards. Audit confirms 99.82% traction voltage stability, 99.994% CBTC signaling telemetry, and zero critical safety defects across 28.2 route-kilometers. Total operational budget allocation stands at \u20b9 459 Lakhs under Contract SLA CNT-2024-058. Assigned Officer: Reshma Varma.",
