      "executiveSummary": "Comprehensive Executive Directive for 'Automatic Fare Collection (AFC) QR Upgrade Tender (DUPLICATE REVISION #6)': Evaluated under KMRL LEGAL Protocols and MoHUA transit safety standards. Audit confirms 99.82% traction voltage stability, 99.994% CBTC signaling telemetry, and zero critical safety defects across 28.2 route-kilometers. Total operational budget allocation stands at \u20b9 603 Lakhs under Contract SLA CNT-2024-026. Assigned Officer: Sneha Roy.",
