      "executiveSummary": "Comprehensive Executive Directive for 'IT Network & Cybersecurity Vulnerability Audit (DUPLICATE REVISION #10)': Evaluated under KMRL IT Protocols and MoHUA transit safety standards. Audit confirms 99.82% traction voltage stability, 99.994% CBTC signaling telemetry, and zero critical safety defects across 28.2 route-kilometers. Total operational budget allocation stands at \u20b9 615 Lakhs under Contract SLA CNT-2024-030. Assigned Officer: Kavita Mishra.",
