      "executiveSummary": "Comprehensive Executive Directive for 'HR Employee Benefit Policy & Night Shift Allowance (DUPLICATE REVISION #14)': Evaluated under KMRL HR Protocols and MoHUA transit safety standards. Audit confirms 99.82% traction voltage stability, 99.994% CBTC signaling telemetry, and zero critical safety defects across 28.2 route-kilometers. Total operational budget allocation stands at \u20b9 627 Lakhs under Contract SLA CNT-2024-034. Assigned Officer: Swati Singhal.",
